# <%= @showing_user.display_name || @showing_user.name %>

[Back to Users](/app-admin/users)

**Email:** `<%= @showing_user.email %>`
**User ID:** `<%= @showing_user.id %>`
**Type:** <%= @showing_user.user_type %>
<% if @showing_user.app_admin? -%>
**Role:** app_admin
<% end -%>
<% if @showing_user.sys_admin? -%>
**Role:** sys_admin
<% end -%>
<% if @showing_user.suspended? -%>
**Status:** SUSPENDED (since <%= time_ago_in_words(@showing_user.suspended_at) %> ago)
**Reason:** <%= @showing_user.suspended_reason %>
<% end -%>
<% if @showing_user.scrubbed_at.present? -%>
**Status:** DELETED (scrubbed <%= time_ago_in_words(@showing_user.scrubbed_at) %> ago)
<% elsif @showing_user.pending_deletion? -%>
**Status:** scheduled for deletion on <%= (@showing_user.deletion_requested_at + AccountDeletionService::GRACE_PERIOD).to_date.to_fs(:long) %><%= " — the user is suspended and cannot restore it themselves; use restore_account" if @showing_user.suspended? %>
<% end -%>

## Subdomains (<%= @user_tenants.count %>)

<% if @user_tenants.any? -%>
| Subdomain | Handle | Role |
|--------|--------|------|
<% @user_tenants.each do |tenant| -%>
<% tu = @showing_user.tenant_users.find { |t| t.tenant_id == tenant.id } -%>
| [<%= tenant.name %>](/app-admin/subdomains/<%= tenant.subdomain %>) | @<%= tu&.handle %> | <%= tenant.is_admin?(@showing_user) ? 'admin' : 'member' %> |
<% end -%>
<% else -%>
*User is not a member of any subdomains.*
<% end -%>

